WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Start with an inactive group
Owned AIO group, no running consumers. Agree replay consequences before changing positions.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Select the exact partition and target
This example returns one partition to its earliest retained offset.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Preview before changing anything
The offset exposure is an upper bound, not a count of records to process.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Confirm the exact group
Review the plan, then type the group ID. Keep consumers stopped.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Apply the reviewed reset once
An uncertain response needs reconciliation before another attempt.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Verify the result before restarting
The broker read-back confirms offset zero. Restarting consumers is a separate step.
